<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for Rust;

Rust f1-CombatLog macro for Rust on steam can be played at 1920×1080 scale resolution.

Configuration below are the ff: 

1. Program Settings section
  1.1  Start tracking the keys» ON «
  1.2. Start the incognito mode» ON «(REQUIRED!)
  2.3. Use the minimum delay «OFF»
  2.4. Bind to any button on mouse
  2.5. Mode of operation « While the key is held down»

In-game settings:
- Enable f1 console in rust settings.
- No mouse sensitivity needed
- Set resolution at » 1920×1080

The macro was tested on:
- ASUS GTX 1650 i5 laptop
- Support Windows 10 20H2
- RUST via Steam</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
